 {"decision_id": "D-073", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "EVIDENCE-PACK REISSUE + SERVICE-PID CONFIRMATION (operator items). (1) Section 5 (coverage matrix) was MISSING - pack jumped 4->6; reissued with the full coverage matrix inline as section 5, numbering continuous 1-11. (2) WIRE PID CONFIRMED FROM LOGS: live_wire 30612 started 2026-07-21 07:52:20Z = the PLANNED LIVE_EDIT wire-half deploy (banner 'live wire WATCH started pid=30612' at 07:52:20Z); watcher 3348 + observer 8068 = PLANNED v2.1 deploy 07:04:30Z. SELF-CORRECTED ERROR (transparency): my first query dropped the DATE and I initially read tracker/listener/companion/shadow as restarting at 09:38Z TODAY (a would-be unplanned event) - the log FILENAMES (companion_20260720_103826) then the full creation dates proved they started 2026-07-20 09:38Z and have run UNCHANGED since; NO unplanned restart. Host LastBootUpTime 2026-07-19 22:37Z (no reboot). MATERIAL: the LISTENER process (started 07-20) predates the staged LIVE_EDIT code (written 07-21 08:50Z), so the RUNNING listener holds the OLD code in memory - LIVE_EDIT is correctly STILL HELD, not accidentally live; it activates only on tonight's planned restart. Confirming-from-logs (per the reviewer) is exactly what caught my date misread. Verdict PASS stands; all 7 PID states log-confirmed as planned/unchanged.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_VERIFICATION_EVIDENCE_PACK.txt", "hash": "pack reissued s5+pids"},
 {"decision_id": "D-072", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "FINAL VERIFICATION PATCH (6 items) + EVIDENCE PACK = DEMO_LANE_BOUNDED_BUILD_VERIFICATION_PASS. Items 1-3 (no consolidation): distinct unknown-ORDER and unknown-POSITION tests; instrumented ordering proof injecting failure at every pre-send boundary (validate/receipt/outbox) asserting broker_call_count equals 0; parameterised seven-field reconciliation matrix mutating each field independently (all 7 detected). Item 4: code-capability separation (executor exposes no successful DEMO_APPROVED writer, PROVEN) reported SEPARATELY from OS-identity separation (process-identity ACL, NOT proven, labelled ACTIVATION PREREQUISITE). Item 5: hard-death test renamed HOST_DEATH_STOP_SURVIVAL_SIMULATION (mock, not real-broker proof); STANDING RULE K-057 registered (no verdict may imply real-broker/real-world proof on mock/sim evidence - 2nd overstated-proof catch after D-071's prose-only claims); ALL verdict strings audited, the one borderline reworded. Suite 58/58. EVIDENCE PACK (DEMO_LANE_VERIFICATION_EVIDENCE_PACK.txt): source SHA-256 manifest, exact command, full raw output, 58-test inventory, network scan NONE (only ctraderapi.com endpoint literals), gate values all False, credential scan NONE, Orange ledger before/after hashes ALL IDENTICAL, seven live services 7/7 running and untouched (build spawned none). VERDICT PASS. Still prohibited and NOT done: OAuth trading scope, gate flip, real adapter activation, any order.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_VERIFICATION_EVIDENCE_PACK.txt", "hash": "VERIFICATION_PASS"},
 {"decision_id": "D-071", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "TEST COVERAGE MATRIX produced + GAPS IMPLEMENTED before sending the build report (operator: the reviewer will count against ~42 named tests). HONEST AUDIT found the earlier 28 OVER-CLAIMED three correction-13 items (hard-process-death, restart-reconcile, stale-pending-cancel were asserted in prose but NOT tested) and lacked ~12 named addendum/F1 tests. IMPLEMENTED (new capability: prices.py representability+min-stop-distance; executor restart_reconcile_first, cancel_stale_orders, cancel_campaign_pending, session/symbol-validity guard; mock normalize_stop/session/tradeable): no-DOWNWARD-rounding (distinct from upward), approval-byte-identical-after-consumption, first-atomic-consumption-succeeds, missing-expiry-blocks, altered-expiry-invalidates, expired-order-not-recreated, stale-broker-order-cancelled, terminal-campaign-cancels-pending, non-representable-entry-rejected, non-representable-stop-rejected, min-stop-distance-violation-rejected, broker-STOP-mismatch (distinct from price), symbol/session-invalidity-blocks, hard-process-death-broker-stop-survives, restart-reconcile-before-action(+unknown-order-NOT_ARMED). SUITE NOW 45/45 PASS. COVERAGE MATRIX (in the report) maps every named test COVERED/CONSOLIDATED/NOT-YET-IMPLEMENTED with consolidation justifications (corr13#6==F3-modified, #7==F3-expired, #9==F2-partial, #12==F2-unknown, addendum1 single-winner==F3#6, replay==F3#4); NOT-YET-IMPLEMENTED = none. Report reissued (DEMO_LANE_BUILD_TEST_REPORT_FOR_SIGNOFF.txt) with matrix. Gates still all False, credentials none, no connection. Nothing activated.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/demo_lane/tests_demo_lane.py", "hash": "45/45 + matrix"},
 {"decision_id": "D-070", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "FINAL_SECOND_REVIEWER_ADDENDUM_001 APPENDED VERBATIM (spec NOT rewritten; addendum takes precedence): item1 resolves an F3 self-contradiction (immutable approval + consumed-state) via a SEPARATE executor-owned consumption receipt with strict ordering validate->receipt->outbox->send, failed-receipt BLOCKS the request; item2 a genuine GAP (section 6a protected FILLED positions but not RESTING orders) fixed with GOOD_TILL_DATE bound to approval+plan-hash; item3 silent-normalization detection via exact-equality reconciliation on all SEVEN fields after acceptance; item4 voids the stale correction-13 wording. RUNNING TALLY: TEN genuine corrections across THREE rounds incl. one flat contradiction (F2) + two gaps (addendum 1,2). BOUNDED BUILD AUTHORISED + EXECUTED strictly within scope (research/farouk_pilot/demo_lane/): isolated executor.py (technically incapable of writing DEMO_APPROVED - write_approval raises), immutable approval_tool.py (write-once O_EXCL, explicit-Martyn-action), durable consumption-receipt + outbox state machine (INTENT_WRITTEN->SENT->ACKED/OUTCOME_UNKNOWN), MOCK broker adapter (NO real cTrader socket in the package), read-only config (all 3 gates hard False), README. TESTS: tests_demo_lane.py 28/28 PASS - covers corr-13 fourteen (endpoint/isLive/account-id/scope refusals, gate-truth-table-no-live-path, unit-conversion halt, approval-hash+expired, response-lost->OUTCOME_UNKNOWN, partial-fill-no-open, hard-close-owned, restart-reconcile, unknown-no-touch, stale-cancel, ledger-exclusion) + F2 four + F3 six + addendum 1/2/3. STILL PROHIBITED and enforced by ABSENCE: no OAuth trade-scope, no DEMO_EXECUTION_ENABLED flip, no order-capable connection (mock only), no order. Build+test report returned BEFORE any OAuth/gate/broker-connected step, as required. REPORT FOR SECOND REVIEWER produced (DEMO_LANE_BUILD_TEST_REPORT_FOR_SIGNOFF.txt): states what was built, all 28 tests + what each proves, prohibitions ENFORCED-BY-ABSENCE (no cTrader socket/requests/ssl imports - scan clean, only *.ctraderapi.com endpoint literals; no executor approval path; no credentials - scan clean) vs BY-CHECK, and confirms all 3 gates hard False + zero credentials from source. METHOD PRAISED (operator): safety-by-absence beats policy; receipt-before-send proven by ZERO orders (absence proof); ledger-separation proven by expectancy-reader-ingests-nothing (wrong-thing-cannot-happen). Awaiting second-reviewer pass before any activation.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/demo_lane/README.md", "hash": "28/28 mock-only"},
 {"decision_id": "D-069", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "SECOND-REVIEWER v0.3 VERDICT = SIGN_OFF_WITH_THREE_FINAL_CORRECTIONS (concept approved, build still NOT authorised). All three accepted -> v0.3.1. F1 (amends corr.3/sizing): exact volume NO ROUNDING EITHER WAY - rounding down silently breaks the corr.4 approval binding (traded != ratified); volume must be >=minVolume AND <=maxVolume AND %stepVolume==0 AND ==exact ratified nominal, else HALT; no broker-min substitution unless that exact min was shown+ratified. F2 (amends LIMIT-only): a FLAT CONTRADICTION caught by the reviewer - LIMIT-only + close-the-filled-quantity is impossible (cannot close with a limit); fix: LIMIT-only governs OPENING; ProtoOAClosePositionReq solely to reduce/close a positively-identified Orange-owned position, never open/increase/reverse/exceed-owned/touch-unknown; +4 proof tests. F3 (approval authority separation, most important, ARCHITECTURAL): executor may write DEMO_APPROVAL_REQUEST but must be TECHNICALLY INCAPABLE of writing/modifying DEMO_APPROVED; separate operator-approval tool + separate dirs with Windows ACLs; binds 14 plan fields + nonce + approval-record-hash + approval-tool-version + expiry + atomic consumed-state; lifecycle REQUESTED->MARTYN_APPROVED->ATOMICALLY_CONSUMED->EXPIRED/COMPLETED; reused/modified/duplicated/expired/partially-consumed FAIL CLOSED; +6 proof tests. OPERATIONAL (F1): nominal shown to Martyn + ratified as an EXACT figure; non-converting nominal HALTS (deliberate friction over trading an unapproved qty). RECORD: second reviewer found SEVEN genuine errors across two rounds incl. ONE FLAT INTERNAL CONTRADICTION - continued two-reviewer vindication. F2/F3 PROOF TESTS now VERBATIM as issued (F2: partial-fill-closable-without-opening/reversing, kill-containment-closes-only-owned-qty, excessive-close-rejected, unknown-position-no-touch; F3: executor-cannot-create-approval, approval-tool-creates-correctly-bound, modified-rejected, replayed-rejected, expired-rejected, simultaneous-consumption-at-most-one-consumer). RELAY ERROR WAS REVIEWER-SIDE not a source gap - the enumeration existed and was lost in relay; Orange's flag (derived-pending-confirmation, not invented) was the correct response. Paste-file DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_3_FOR_SIGNOFF.txt regenerated. Nothing built/authorised.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_3_PROPOSED.md", "hash": "v0.3.1"},
 {"decision_id": "D-068", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "SECOND-REVIEWER VERDICT on demo spec v0.2 = SIGN_OFF_WITH_REQUIRED_CORRECTIONS (build NOT authorised, gate NOT authorised, OAuth trade-scope NOT authorised - correct posture). All 13 corrections accepted. FOUR were GENUINE TECHNICAL ERRORS in work the primary reviewer specified and Orange built: (1) accountType is HEDGED/NETTED classification NOT the live/demo discriminator - the primary safeguard read the WRONG field; replaced with conjunction demo-endpoint AND isLive==false AND exact allowlisted ctidTraderAccountId AND expected broker/env AND SCOPE_TRADE. (3) 0.01 lots is not a protocol volume - requires symbol-metadata conversion (symbolId/lotSize/minVolume/stepVolume), never round up, aggregate cap. (7) clientOrderId is NOT server-guaranteed exactly-once - idempotency claim unfounded; durable order-intent/outbox state machine, OUTCOME_UNKNOWN on lost response, reconcile before any retry. (9) disconnect semantics were IMPOSSIBLE - a disconnected process cannot flatten; halt locally, rely on broker-side stops, reconnect-reconcile-first, NOT_ARMED until safe. v0.3 PRODUCED (DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_3_PROPOSED.md) incorporating these 4 verbatim + two operational implications surfaced plainly: (8) Orange needs an EXCLUSIVE dedicated demo account - Martyn must not manually trade it, any manual position triggers the unknown-position halt; (12) ONE approved campaign at a time - overlapping Farouk campaigns => demo lane takes only the FIRST (realistic: F006->F007 17.6h apart), stated as a known limitation. UPDATE (D-068 cont.): FULL 13-item list received verbatim; corrections 1-12 all incorporated into v0.3 (new sections 2a credential-handling, 2a gate-truth-table, 4 approval-binding-14-fields, 6a LIMIT-only+protection-at-request+partial-fill-halt, 7a reconciliation-policy, 10a order-expiry, 8 domain-specific eligibility flags, 12b immutable safety caps). Correction 13 TRUNCATED IN TRANSMISSION ('Include proof tests for: live endpoint refusal; ...') - only the live-endpoint-refusal item received and incorporated; COMPLETED: correction 13's full text received (14 named proof tests) and folded into section 10.5 verbatim. v0.3 NOW COMPLETE - all 13 corrections incorporated; paste-ready file DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_3_FOR_SIGNOFF.txt produced for second-reviewer sign-off. Still nothing built/authorised. TWO-REVIEWER REQUIREMENT VINDICATED: four errors found in work the primary reviewer specified and the builder implemented - neither would have caught them alone. Nothing built/authorised.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_3_PROPOSED.md", "hash": "v0.3 partial-pending-7"},
 {"decision_id": "D-067", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "VAD-TIMESTAMP BLAST-RADIUS AUDIT (operator, after K-056). transcribe_corpus.py (vad_filter=True) stores VAD-compressed timestamps in .txt AND .jsonl - drift accumulates with length. CONSUMERS: G1 extraction FIXED; rule citations = approximate pointers, re-locate at use; corpus index stores no timestamps (clean); future SMC detectors (not built) - re-locate requirement ADDED to D-040 binding condition; video frame refs + H-FPL-05 zones - zones are PRICE values (drift-IMMUNE), frames are on-screen-clock visual citations not scorer inputs. EXTRACTION WAS THE ONLY REAL-AUDIO-SEEK CONSUMER; no corrected-mapping artifact needed - fix is re-locate-at-consumption. SAVING REASON for 16/16 recorded: the automated batch clipped EVERY source per rule (redundancy, not single-timestamp correctness). FR-058 FLAGGED strongest-supported rule (triple-corroborated: doctrine + F006 45938 + F007 45973) -> natural first candidate for a future Lane B management policy, NOT now, NOT without its own pre-registration. APPLIED 2026-07-21 (operator: a label in the data beats a recommendation in a report): VAD_APPROXIMATE header written into all 23 .txt (line 1) + all 23 .jsonl (first _meta record, g1 consumers skip it cleanly) + timestamp_basis flag on the corpus-index source records + transcribe_corpus.py patched so future transcripts carry both headers automatically. Re-transcribe no-VAD remains optional, only if precise STORED timing is ever needed as data.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/corpus/transcribe_corpus.py", "hash": "vad blast-radius"},
 {"decision_id": "D-066", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "G1 OPERATOR EAR ROUND + METHOD-DEFECT INVESTIGATION. RESOLVED 4 by operator ear: FR-058 CLOSE_WORST_HOLD_BEST (triple-corroborated: doctrine + F006 45938 + F007 45973), FR-051 BELOW_THIS_WICK, FR-056 CORRECTION (spoken 100/200 pips, NOT 200/250 - answer contradicts the AVR, a genuine correction), FR-086 ON_SCREEN_NOT_SPOKEN. Register -> 68 CANDIDATE / 11 pending. SYSTEMATIC PROBLEM DIAGNOSED (K-056): 5/11 operator clips missed their token because (1) manifest extracted from sources[0] only while merged rules carry the token in another source, (2) vad_filter=True transcript timestamps drift from real audio, + container-seek imprecision. AUDIT of the 16 auto-resolved: 16/16 CLEAN (batch clipped every source; token present in each rule's own clips; verifications VALID, not invalidated). RE-STAGED 4 from correct sources: FR-008/FR-041/FR-099 verified token-present; FR-027 token located (~00:34:44 Sunday-12 'four zero 70 four zero 60') but one mp4's container-seek quirk defeated the clip -> operator manual-seek fallback (RESTAGED_NOTE.md). Remaining pending: FR-055/063/076 (operator did not report a clear answer) + FR-013/034/039/061 (auto-retry with wider clips) + the 4 re-staged awaiting operator ear.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/stage2_rule_mining/operator_clips_g1/RESTAGED_NOTE.md", "hash": "method fixed"},
 {"decision_id": "D-065", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "BUNDLED DEPLOY APPROVED for tonight's 21:00-22:00Z maintenance window (one window, not two restarts). (1) V3 TERMINAL-MARKER DEPLOY approved - live_wire_v3 (b160b556fb8792fc) -> live_wire.py; same discipline (before/after shas, banner-confirmed running build, ledger byte-identity, cursor intact, gates re-read, 7/7 single-instance); malformed-marker fail-open preserved. (2) RETRO-MARKERS F002/F004/F007 approved WITH CONDITION EXPLICITLY CONFIRMED: XAU_F_TERMINAL_OUTCOME for genuinely-outcome-closed campaigns - NOT adjudications, adjudication preconditions DO NOT APPLY and must not be invoked, no named defect, NO number changed (F002 +9.95 / F004 +15.18 / F007 +5.38 stand), no exclusion, no expectancy row affected; append-only, per-leg states from tracker. (3) ~6h POST-MARKER WINDOW ratified in principle, deploy AFTER the marker is live (sequenced, not bundled - marker changes the population); value frozen with 3.9h-tail+headroom derivation; K-052 review trigger set (re-derive when count >> 7; both extremes single-obs at n=7). (4) PROXIMITY IMPOSSIBILITY recorded as PROOF K-055 (not recommendation): tail 3.9h > interval 2.2h => no single window works => terminal-marker NECESSARY; full-distribution derivation recorded as method. Window plan: work_orders/TONIGHT_MAINTENANCE_WINDOW_20260721_2100Z.md. Nothing executed now - staged for the window; listener restart remains Martyn's call inside it.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/TONIGHT_MAINTENANCE_WINDOW_20260721_2100Z.md", "hash": "bundle approved"},
 {"decision_id": "D-064", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "18h PROXIMITY WINDOW RE-JUSTIFIED (report-only, awaiting ratification). Derived from the FULL observed spacing distribution (7 campaigns, not the closest pair): min inter-campaign interval 2.2h (F003->F004), max management-tail 3.9h (F001). DECISIVE: management-tail (3.9h) > min interval (2.2h) => NO single time-proximity window can both catch all same-session management (>=3.9h) and avoid two-campaign overlap (<2.2h) - window-narrowing alone is mathematically insufficient, proven from data. The TERMINAL-MARKER (D-063) is therefore the NECESSARY fix (removes closed campaigns so the window only disambiguates genuinely-concurrent opens). RECOMMENDED post-marker window ~6h (>= 3.9h max tail + headroom; same-session per drift-canary), P02 fail-closed backstop for residual concurrency. 18h confirmed unfit (8x the 2.2h min interval, never justified - K-052 failure class). Value change awaits ratification; no code changed.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/PROPOSED_TERMINAL_OUTCOME_MARKERS_F002_F004_F007.md", "hash": "spacing-derived"},
 {"decision_id": "D-063", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "TERMINAL-MARKER CANONICAL SHAPE BUILT + PROVEN (staged, awaiting approval to deploy/apply). live_wire_v3_terminal_marker.py (sha b160b556fb8792fc): load_campaign_state now honors append-only XAU_F_TERMINAL_OUTCOME (clean outcome, no defect) and XAU_F_TERMINAL_ADJUDICATION (defect-affected, F006's case) records - a campaign with either marker leaves the open set. PROOF terminal_marker_proof.py 4/4: (1) NO-OP on current ledger - v3 open set == live == [F002,F004,F007]; (2) marker closes exactly its target, others unchanged; (3) malformed marker (no setup_id) fails-OPEN (never fabricates a close). PROPOSED RETRO-MARKERS drafted for F002/F004/F007 (work_orders/PROPOSED_TERMINAL_OUTCOME_MARKERS...) - clean BE-scratch outcomes, per-leg states from tracker, NO number change / NO exclusion / NO adjudication (distinct from F006); NOT WRITTEN. Deploy (wire restart at clean window) + marker-write (dry-run/apply/idempotency/scoped-verify) both await operator approval. On apply: open set -> [], WIRE_NOMINAL_OPEN_OUTCOME_TERMINALS resolved, demo-spec 4a satisfied, and a wire hook auto-marks future outcome-terminals so the set never regrows.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/always_on_tradingview_receiver_plan/stage_c_tooling/farouk_plus/parser_replay/terminal_marker_proof.py", "hash": "b160b556fb8792fc"},
 {"decision_id": "D-062", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "PAIRED LANE A / LANE B SHADOW SCORING switched ON from F008 (reviewer directive; primary evidence stream, takes precedence over further research once demo prerequisites clear). SPEC: work_orders/PAIRED_LANE_A_B_SHADOW_SCORING_SPEC.md; HARNESS: paired_scoring/paired_scoring_v0_1.py (ARMED, F008-guarded - refuses <=F007, verified; no F008 exists yet so nothing scored). OBJECTIVE CEILING recorded as K-054: parity with a PERFECT FOLLOWER OF PUBLISHED SIGNALS, NOT his personal account (unobservable per K-018+K-053); never restate as 'match Farouk'. PER-CAMPAIGN 3-COLUMN OUTPUT: Lane A (Const v0.1, unchanged baseline) vs Lane B (P-EP-1 entry 0.15/0.40 no-far-leg + P-DM-1 BE+50/50%-TP1 defaults where no explicit instruction) vs SOURCE-OBSERVED (OCR fills) - fills/count/realised/terminal+cause/delta, every campaign win or lose. BINDING: Lane B writes ONLY paired_scores_v0_1.jsonl (never Lane A/freeze/learning); P-EP-1 abandon/revise predicate governs, no quiet retuning; underperformance IS the finding. PRE-REGISTERED 'NOT AN IMPROVEMENT' JUDGMENT (declared BEFORE any scoring, over first 5 fill-achieving F008+ campaigns): Lane B judged NOT-an-improvement if ANY of (1) result <= Lane A in >=3/5 (median delta<=0), (2) mean entry-distance-to-source NOT smaller than Lane A's, (3) >=2 terminals strictly worse than Lane A from the entry/mgmt change (stopped where A survived / default exit forfeits a runner A kept); asymmetric hard bar - burden on Lane B to show edge; no promotion at n=5 (D-009 stands).", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/PAIRED_LANE_A_B_SHADOW_SCORING_SPEC.md", "hash": "harness armed"},
 {"decision_id": "D-061", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "G1 BATCH ADJUDICATED (126 clips, 0 OCR/transcribe errors; auto-classifier ABANDONED as unreliable - it mis-bucketed FR-024 which the clip clearly resolves - and replaced with per-rule CLIP READING per the recorded discipline). This pass resolved 16 rules by reading medium.en clips for the load-bearing token (2 timeframe pilot-adjacent FR-024/FR-049; then 14: FR-002/004/006/009/016/029/030/031/033/043/068/075/097/098) - each verification record cites the specific clip phrase (e.g. 'five and fifteen minutes', 'you see WICKS on the downside', 'CME will open... big WICK', 'look for LONGS'). REGISTER NOW: 64 CANDIDATE / 15 CANDIDATE_G1_PENDING_AUDIO / 20 OBSERVATION / 9 CRYPTO_SCOPED_EXCLUDED. 15 STILL PENDING (clip does not decisively resolve the load-bearing token - honestly left, NOT force-resolved): FR-008/027/041/051/055/076/086 (price/pip DIGITS or negation not confirmable from clip), FR-013 (pivot 'week/wick' not confirmed), FR-034/039/061 (timeframe list not in the pulled clip window), FR-056/058/063/099 (percentages/self-contradictions needing operator ear). These need wider clip windows or operator ear - a future pass, never auto-resolved. DISCIPLINE HELD: mishear table = suspicions not corrections (D-051/D-052); resolved only where a clip shows the corrected token or the meaning is provably invariant under a non-directional vocab substitution.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/stage2_rule_mining/g1_verifications_v0_1.jsonl", "hash": "16 resolved this pass"},
 {"decision_id": "D-060", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "OPERATOR CORRECTION - K-053 IMPLICATION NARROWED. The prior framing over-stated the consequence: it implied relay failure creates a deficiency in LANE A COMPLETENESS. It does not. Lane A measures what a disciplined SUBSCRIBER could reproduce from DELIVERED instructions; a signal that never reached Telegram is OUTSIDE Lane A's scope by definition (no subscriber could act on it), NOT a missed trade within it. CORRECTED SCOPE: (1) Lane A campaign capture is COMPLETE w.r.t. delivered signals - its correct definition - NO qualification needed; (2) what stays unknowable is FAROUK'S PERSONAL trade set, now with a second beyond-observation mechanism (relay failure, alongside K-018 unposted outcomes + private fills); (3) his claimed personal performance and Lane A expectancy are NOT like-for-like and must never be compared as such - a PRE-EXISTING constraint to which 45797 adds a reason, not a new deficiency. 45797 stays registered as first-person relay-failure evidence; its consequence is scoped to the source-comparison problem only. K-053 text + effect amended in place.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/brain_build_v0_1.py (K-053)", "hash": "scope corrected"},
 {"decision_id": "D-059", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "RELAY-FAILURE BLINDSPOT ELEVATED to its own claim K-053 (operator): the capture blindspot has >=2 independent mechanisms - (a) source-side non-post (K-018), (b) DISCORD RELAY FAILURE delivering a posted signal (45797 first-person + 45799 corroboration; cross-trader 45512). Mechanism (b) is worse: invisible downstream, UNDETECTABLE FROM BARS (no zone ever published), unmitigable by our parsing/monitoring. Expectancy implication recorded permanently: campaign set incomplete by an unknown+unmeasurable amount; no expectancy figure ever covers 'all his trades'. CORPUS/ARCHIVE SEARCH DONE: evidence-DB 45797+45799 (Farouk relay-fail), 45512 (.ccolumbus non-post), transcript fp-friday-10-jul 'I just forgot to post... yesterday two sales' (source-side); K-018 video 'sell at 4020' (source-side). ALSO RECORDED (operator): the external quarantine proposal's CATEGORY LABELS were unreliable INDEPENDENT of its verdicts - it grouped 45784 (sea-scalper channel) under 'Farouk Gold Channel Commentary' and mislabelled 45825/45942 reason as generic 'off-scope' - reading actual headers caught errors the proposer and reviewer both missed; standing lesson: verify a proposal's CATEGORISATION from source, not just its final verdict.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/brain_build_v0_1.py (K-053)", "hash": "K-053"},
 {"decision_id": "D-058", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "QUARANTINE QUEUE CLEARED (26->0) after INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION of an externally-proposed verdict set (NOT applied blind, operator instruction). TWO DISAGREEMENTS FOUND AND CORRECTED: (1) 45940 proposed COMMENTARY -> CORRECTED to ACTIONABLE_MISSED: named in PARTIAL_INSTRUCTION_SILENT_LOSS (D-028), and re-parse under DEPLOYED v2.1 = MANAGEMENT (HOLD_LEG_SELECTIVE + TP_LEVEL_NOTE) - filing COMMENTARY would have deleted a recorded parser gap from the evidence trail (the reviewer flagged this; confirmed from records). (2) 45784 proposed COMMENTARY -> CORRECTED to CORRECTLY_QUARANTINED: header is 'seascalperfarouk Posted in sea-scalper-farouk' (NOT gold-trades), v2.1=NOT_FAROUK_GOLD - it is off-gate by channel, not gold-channel commentary; COMMENTARY would misrepresent an off-gate message as an in-channel no-action decision. VERIFICATION METHOD: every verdict checked against the actual message header (author+channel, not the proposal's assertion), the defect register, and a v2.1 re-parse. Agreements confirmed: 23 CORRECTLY_QUARANTINED (16 .ccolumbus + 3 wazwithazed + 1 navigatorjosh + 3 Farouk-sea-scalper/BTC off-gate), 2 COMMENTARY (45797/45814 Farouk gold-trades, v2.1=OTHER, no instruction). NOTED: 45797 ('pressed sell but Discord failed to send the alert') is standalone evidence of an unposted/relay-failed trade (K-018/K-049 family) - verdict COMMENTARY stands but the capture-blindspot evidence is logged. Resolutions durable in quarantine_resolutions_v0_1.jsonl (hash-bound). Final: 26 resolutions {CORRECTLY_QUARANTINED:23, COMMENTARY:2, ACTIONABLE_MISSED:1}, 0 pending.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/quarantine_resolutions_v0_1.jsonl", "hash": "26 resolved"},
 {"decision_id": "D-057", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "WINDOW AUDIT RATIFIED (operator): systemic finding recorded - of 6 frozen windows only the 24h orphan-management canary was event-rate-justified (REFERENCE EXAMPLE); the other five asserted to varying degrees. (1) 18h PROXIMITY re-justification RATIFIED as a demo-lane prerequisite alongside the terminal-marker (register item PROXIMITY_WINDOW_NOT_EVENT_RATE_JUSTIFIED); constraint recorded: must be NARROWER than the minimum observed inter-campaign interval, derived from the FULL spacing distribution not the closest pair; F006->F007 17.6h is an already-breached upper bound. (2) K-052 EXTENDED to a CREATION-TIME PRECONDITION (not a review step): any future frozen window must state its event-rate justification in the record when frozen, or be refused. (3) 48h zone-match tolerance + 7-day verification cadence ACCEPTED as low-stakes ASSUMED values with rationale recorded - stay labelled ASSUMED, must NOT be quoted as derived. Report-only; no window values changed.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/brain_build_v0_1.py (K-052)", "hash": "audit ratified"},
 {"decision_id": "D-056", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "H-FPL-07 v2 RATIFIED (operator), PROSPECTIVE ONLY (h_fpl_07_predicate_v2_frozen.json): forward-only window, fire -> next post within 60 min, DISQUALIFIED if a closer OPPOSITE-DIRECTION fire intervenes (the disqualifier is the load-bearing part - else a same-direction fire an hour out scores 'preceding' with a contradictory fire between it and the post); direction must match. Effective NEXT session onward. BOUNDARY ENFORCED: today's LIVE013 NOT rescored under v2 - v1 result (NEGATIVE on precede) stands; applying v2 to observed data = retrospective fitting; raw fire data preserved, future v2 application allowed ONLY if labelled RETROSPECTIVE_NOT_PROSPECTIVE, never prospective evidence. v1 marked SUPERSEDED_BY_DESIGN_FLAW (not deleted; rows retained). GENERAL LESSON K-052: window width must be justified against the source's observed event rate BEFORE freezing - a window wider than the inter-event interval cannot discriminate; applies to all future pre-registered windows.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/h_fpl_07_predicate_v2_frozen.json", "hash": "v2 frozen"},
 {"decision_id": "D-055", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "LIVE013 HEADLINE = FIRE RATE, NOT PRECEDE (operator): K-051 recorded - directional-A alert stream is NOT a trade-selection signal (11 fires/5.5h bidirectional vs 1 post; ~24 positions/day both ways vs his 1); the alert stream is EXCLUDED as the selection mechanism. LANE C search REDIRECTED to confluence stack + session/no-trade conditions + HTF context (revised assessment, n=1, evidence not conclusion; yesterday filter-tractability revision NOT overturned). NON-DISCRIMINATING FIELD CAVEAT PINNED to h_fpl_07_scores_v1.json itself: resulting_post=F007 across all 11 rows is an artefact of a single-post day + the +/-4h window, NEVER quotable as '11/11 fires followed by a post'. WINDOW-FITNESS FIX PROPOSED (not applied; changing a pre-registered field needs ratification): the +/-4h symmetric window is unfit for a ~1-post/day source at ~2 fires/hr (guarantees resulting_post!=none by construction); replace with a FORWARD-ONLY shorter window (next post within ~60min AND no closer opposite-direction fire) so 'precede' is meaningful - fix BEFORE the next session, never mid-analysis.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/h_fpl_07_scores_v1.json", "hash": "caveat pinned"},
 {"decision_id": "D-054", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "LIVE013 STOPPED 12:00Z (operator-confirmed 12:02Z) + ONE-TIME ENUMERATION RUN (D-013 discipline verbatim): Worker baseline 2045cdb140604750 -> temp token-gated list+bodies branch (2 deploys) -> REVERTED BYTE-EXACT 2045cdb140604750; post-revert GET /__verify_list__ = 405 (branch gone), temp token + backup DESTROYED, bar feed ALIVE (fresh bar 12:07:00Z close 4059.86); no secret used/printed; R2 append-only untouched. ENUMERATED 785 objects, 380 events in the 06:29-12:00Z window. PRIMARY: directional-A DID fire - 11 fires (8 A SHORT, 3 A LONG): 06:51/07:00 SHORT, 07:33 LONG, 07:45/08:09 SHORT, 09:09 LONG, 09:27/09:51 SHORT, 10:12 LONG, 11:42/12:00 SHORT. LANE C precede-test (F007 LONG @08:26:42Z): 5 fires preceded - 1 A LONG (07:33, 53.7min before) + 4 A SHORT (nearest pre-fire 08:09 was OPPOSITE); whole-window 8S/3L. VERDICT: NO CLEAN PRECEDE SIGNAL - a consistent A LONG existed but is indistinguishable from noise; A-fires fire both directions ~2/hr continuously regardless of the single eventual post. n=1, EVIDENCE NOT CONCLUSION. H-FPL-07 scored: 11 per-fire rows (h_fpl_07_scores_v1.json) with pre-registered fields verbatim (session/day/hrs-to-daily+weekly-close/3m-bar/stated-no-trade=none-in-force/resulting-post) - NO field added or altered; resulting_post=F007 for all (only post that day, all within +/-4h) with the discriminating question deferred to the Lane C test as designed. SESSION OUTCOME HONEST: NOT null and NOT failed - the catch-all captured a rich directional-A stream the named mirrors never expose; the precede-hypothesis is UNSUPPORTED at n=1 but the capture purpose succeeded (proved A-fires exist, frequent, bidirectional, non-anticipatory). A null would have been a valid result too; this is a negative on the hypothesis, a positive on the capture.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DIRECTIONAL_A_TIMEBOX_CHECKLIST.md", "hash": "enumeration 785 objs"},
 {"decision_id": "D-053", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "OQ-13 SHARPENED (operator clarification): spoken ladder recorded as SOURCE_REPORTED/PERSONAL_LIVE_METHOD_UNCONFIRMED with the operator's interpretation FLAGGED AS INTERPRETATION (~$1k -> 0.1-0.2 lots; $15-20k -> 1 lot); contradiction with the Whaleroom Trading Guide is BIDIRECTIONAL (spoken ~3x larger at $1k, ~2-3x smaller at $20k) - single era-drift cannot explain both directions; five candidate explanations recorded, none selected; resolution route stated (correlate OCR lot labels x account label x date - read-only, not now); sizing disclaimer reiterated on the record (documentary only; no sizing logic under any gate; demo 0.01 nominal unaffected).", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/open_questions (built)", "hash": "OQ-13 v2"},
 {"decision_id": "D-052", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "FR-079 RESOLVED BY OPERATOR EAR: 'do more than that' - NO negation present; verification record written (MARTYN_OPERATOR_EAR), register builder flipped it -> 48 CANDIDATE / 31 G1-pending. REVIEWER-MISREADING RECORDED against the segment: the statement is internally coherent as an ascending sizing ladder (below $1,000 use 0.1; at $1,000 size up), not a reversed risk cap - the transcript was right, the suspicion was human. PRINCIPLE EXTENDED (guardrails): suspicion of a transcript is itself an unverified hypothesis with its own false-positive rate - two of the pilot's flagged suspicions (seg 5, seg 7) proved GENUINE statements wrongly suspected; neither the mishear table nor reviewer intuition may override audio without verification. OQ-13 REGISTERED: sizing-ladder contradiction between the Sunday session audio (0.1 below $1k) and the Whaleroom Trading Guide table (0.03-0.06 at $1k) - era drift / product / account-type (STD vs VIP, OQ-12 link) all candidate explanations, none preferred, both citations stand.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/stage2_rule_mining/g1_verifications_v0_1.jsonl", "hash": "FR-079 record"},
 {"decision_id": "D-051", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "G1 PILOT RATIFIED + STANDING PRINCIPLE RECORDED (guardrails addendum): the mishear table is a list of SUSPICIONS, NEVER corrections - per-segment audio verification mandatory; a wrongly-corrected rule reads plausibly and is undetectable downstream (the more dangerous failure direction). Proven by segment 5: the table would have falsified the GENUINE 'CHoCH under three and one minutes' (3m+1m, corroborated by the 3m indicator standard + F007 rationale). METHOD RECORDED: in-audio semantic anchors outrank surface transcription (segment 1: '9 o'clock until 9.15' resolves '50 minutes'=15 where both models transcribe 50); anchor must live inside the verified segment. Per-rule cited-segment verification stands, no family shortcuts. OPERATOR TASK PREPARED (segment 7): clip at stage2_rule_mining/operator_clips/SEGMENT7_sizing_negation_Sun5Jul_2h05m10s-2h06m20s.mp3 (Sunday 5 July video, 02:05:10-02:06:20, generous pad) - both models hear 'if you have a thousand dollar account do more than that'; Martyn resolves by ear or it stays pending indefinitely; negation NOT inferred from logic per the gate's purpose. REMAINING 32 RULES: batch launched via g1_verify_fast.py - 126 cited segments (every pending rule x first cited timestamp per source), ffmpeg pre-clip + medium.en.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/STAGE2_RULE_MINING_GUARDRAILS.md", "hash": "addendum"},
 {"decision_id": "D-050", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "G1 AUDIO PILOT FIRST RUN (7 segments, medium.en clip corroboration): ORB '50 minutes' RESOLVED = 15 MINUTES (explicit x4 in the 01:28 segment + 9:00-9:15 in-audio anchor at 01:00); close-stack RESOLVED = 5m/15m/1h (Friday segment explicit); CHoCH 'three and one minutes' CONFIRMED GENUINE = 3m AND 1m, NOT a 5m mishear (verbatim in medium.en; corroborated by the 3m chart standard + F007's '1/3m Bullish CHoCH' rationale) - a real correction to the suspected-mishear reading; range-mgmt phrase corrected ('go out and invest' -> 'go out and in fast') but pip digits STILL AMBIGUOUS; sizing negation NOT resolved (medium.en agrees with the suspect surface 'do more than that' - meaning inferable only from context, stays PENDING for operator ear). Method accuracy: 4/7 segments decisively resolved, 1 partially, 2 pending - machine corroboration works where the audio is clean, correctly refuses where it is not. THREE verification records written (FR-012, FR-025, FR-026) -> register 47 CANDIDATE / 32 G1-pending (FR-079 correctly stays pending). EFFICIENCY ADOPTED (reviewer): remaining 32 rules verified via ffmpeg pre-clip (g1_verify_fast.py, registered D-042 method) - seconds per segment vs full-file decode.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/stage2_rule_mining/g1_verifications_v0_1.jsonl", "hash": "pilot raw g1_pilot_raw_v0_1.json"},
 {"decision_id": "D-049", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "SAMPLE-BASIS AMENDMENT ACKNOWLEDGED (reviewer, explicit): P-EP-1 basis n=11->n=20 distinct fills, values untouched (0.15/0.40, no far leg). STANDING PRACTICE RECORDED: any change to a frozen record's cited basis requires explicit reviewer acknowledgement even when values are unchanged. K-050 softening accepted and recorded as correct self-correction behaviour ('never deep' -> 'rarely deep 1/20' on enlarged evidence; far-leg statement stands, deepest observed 0.81 < 1.0). OBSERVATION RECORDED NOT ACTED ON (policy record): second leg at 0.40 now sits in sparse territory (2/20 middle-third fills) - both legs may belong shallower; DO NOT RETUNE (revise predicate is keyed to F008+ forward campaigns, not retrospective growth); recorded as CANDIDATE DIRECTION so a legitimately-triggered revision finds it on the trail. Edge-tolerance disclosure kept visible (4/9 June fills at-or-outside arrival edge). Proceeding to G1 audio pass.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/LANE_B_CANDIDATE_POLICY_DEFAULT_MANAGEMENT.md", "hash": "ack recorded"},
 {"decision_id": "D-048", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "ARCHIVE-ERA ZONE EXTENSION RUN (operator follow-up to D-047): joined the 37 unmatched OCR rows to the 240-signal archive DB (data/signal_archive.db) - 21 rows matched June-era zones = +9 DISTINCT FILLS (34 rows remain unmatched, disclosed). June-era: 8 shallow, 1 DEEP (0.81, 2026-06-25 LONG 4007.94 in [4006,4016]) - FIRST deep-third observation; 4 of 9 at-or-outside the arrival edge within match tolerance. COMBINED SAMPLE n=20 distinct fills / ~13 campaigns / 7 weeks: SHALLOW 17 (85%) / MIDDLE 2 / DEEP 1, median depth ~0.2 - shape CONFIRMED on the enlarged sample; 'never deep' softens to 'rarely deep (1/20)'; K-050 far-leg statement stands (deepest observed 0.81 < far-leg placement 1.0). P-EP-1 values UNCHANGED (0.15/0.40, no far leg) - sample-basis amendment n=11->n=20 recorded, NOT a retune; operator acknowledgement requested per the no-quiet-retuning rule.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/ocr_trial/FILL_DISTRIBUTION_ANALYSIS.md", "hash": "archive join"},
 {"decision_id": "D-047", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "LANE B ENTRY-PLACEMENT PARAMETERS RATIFIED WITH AMENDMENT (operator): P-EP-1 = legs at depth 0.15/0.40 from arrival edge, NO far leg, frozen with FILL_DISTRIBUTION_ANALYSIS.md cited; shadow-only, prospective from F008, retrospective rows labelled. AMENDMENT APPLIED: sample basis stated PROMINENTLY on the frozen record (FITTED to 11 distinct fills / 6 campaigns / survivorship-limited = overfitting risk regardless of distribution cleanliness); REVISE-vs-ABANDON predicate PRE-REGISTERED BEFORE SCORING: over first 5 fill-achieving F008+ campaigns with captured cards - ABANDON if >=2 campaigns place deepest distinct fill in the deep third OR pooled shallow share <40%; REVISE (new version, larger sample) if pooled median depth outside [0.10,0.45] with shape holding; STAND otherwise; uncaptured-card campaigns NOT_SCORABLE (feeds D-041 task); never quietly retuned. K-050 recorded: far leg NEVER filled across six campaigns both directions = structural fact. LANE A IMPLICATION RECORDED WITHOUT CHANGE (Constitution untouched): the ratified model places a leg where he never enters and its first leg at the worst obtainable zone price, so Lane A expectancy sits below his published results BY CONSTRUCTION - a measurement-instrument finding for all future expectancy discussions. FOLLOW-UP OPEN: archive-era zone extension for the 37 unmatched rows (sample enlargement beyond n=11) - next work block.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/LANE_B_CANDIDATE_POLICY_DEFAULT_MANAGEMENT.md", "hash": "P-EP-1 frozen"},
 {"decision_id": "D-046", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "OCR DATASET TRUSTED (operator verified the 10-image random sample - all rows match stored images; recorded in OCR_FULL_PASS_REPORT.md + operator_sample_verified.flag). OQ-12 registered: XAUUSD-STD account variant (single row, msg 45103, NO readable result) - multiplier equivalence UNVERIFIABLE from current data, not assumed; STD rows excluded from mixed arithmetic. FILL-DISTRIBUTION ANALYSIS RUN (trust-gated; survivorship-limited, mechanical only, never expectancy): 18 matched fills across F002-F007 both directions; DIRECTION-NORMALIZED DEPTH from the arrival edge: SHALLOW 16 / MIDDLE 2 / DEEP 0 (median depth ~0.24; distinct-fill view 9/2/0). THE MID-ZONE (SHALLOW-EDGE) CLUSTERING IS SYSTEMATIC, NOT COINCIDENTAL: the model's far leg (depth 1.0) has NEVER filled in the observed record; on shallow penetrations the model fills only its arrival-edge leg (worst price in zone) while his fills sit at depth 0.2-0.4 - the F007 premature-scratch mechanism operating in every observed campaign. Disclosures: 37 rows unmatched (pre-F001 era, no ledger zone); F006 above-zone fill 4013.02 excluded by match tolerance (conservative). This distribution is the designated frozen-parameter source for the Lane B entry-placement candidate; proposed freeze (FOR OPERATOR APPROVAL, not applied): legs at depth 0.15/0.40 of zone from arrival edge, no far leg.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/ocr_trial/FILL_DISTRIBUTION_ANALYSIS.md", "hash": "see file + flag"},
 {"decision_id": "D-045", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "F007 EXPECTANCY DECISION (operator): KEEP IT IN - recommendation accepted in full, reasoning recorded VERBATIM as governance principle in work_orders/EXPECTANCY_EXCLUSION_GOVERNANCE_RULE.md. STANDING RULE: an outcome may only be excluded from the expectancy set where a NAMED DEFECT corrupted its computation; model-unfavourable results produced correctly by the ratified model are NEVER excluded; any future exclusion proposal must state which named defect corrupted the number, or be refused. F007 stays flagged MODEL_ARTEFACT_TERMINAL (comparison only). Expectancy rows: F004 +15.18 / F005 NO_FILL / F007 +5.38 flagged; F006 excluded (PARTIAL_INSTRUCTION_SILENT_LOSS); no figure computed or quoted at n=3. Also operator-accepted: bar verification, live-correctness answer, and the honest null on the 11 SUPERSEDES verdicts (negative-finding reporting endorsed).", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/EXPECTANCY_EXCLUSION_GOVERNANCE_RULE.md", "hash": "see file"},
 {"decision_id": "D-044", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "F007 DIVERGENCE MECHANISM PROVEN (operator source screenshot ~09:54Z + independent bars) - LANE_A_ENTRY_MODEL_ADVERSE_DIVERGENCE ESCALATED TO HIGHEST SEVERITY. Evidence: his chart shows OPEN BUY +943 USD with SL at 4059.71 (= his lowest fill); bars: first touch <=4063 09:29Z low 4062.54 (Lane A P10 scratch), post-instruction low 4061.07 @09:42Z, NEVER reached 4059.71, price 4068.68 by 09:55Z. Same instruction ('sl entry on lowest entry') resolved to 4063 in Lane A (only filled leg) vs 4059.71 for him (lowest actual fill) -> Lane A PREMATURE TERMINAL, forfeited a runner the source still holds. F007 STANDS - NOT unfrozen, NOT amended; +5.38 flagged MODEL_ARTEFACT_TERMINAL. RECOMMENDATION (decision = operator's): KEEP F007 in the expectancy row set - unlike F006 (defect corrupted the outcome), +5.38 IS the true strict-follower result under the ratified constitution: Lane A expectancy measures what THE MODEL produces, and excluding model-unfavorable outcomes would bias the headline upward; the divergence belongs in the comparison lane, not in an exclusion. LIVE CORRECTNESS ANSWERED: F007 has no FINAL_CLOSE token -> nominally OPEN to the wire -> further source management messages CORRELATE to F007 (only campaign inside 18h; F006 adjudicated closed, F004 outside window) and are RECORDED as instruction events/card revisions; the engine is OUTCOME_FROZEN and position-flat so no false fills/outcomes can mint - safe, record-only (45979 'still holding' already correctly filed as commentary). NOTED for terminal-marker design: with an outcome-terminal marker, such messages would ORPHAN to loud review instead of silently annotating a finished campaign - the correct demo-lane behavior. Lane B ENTRY-PLACEMENT candidate registered with this as direct evidence (params to be frozen from fill data/OQ-10 output before scoring). Listener restart remains HELD (source campaign live).", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/LANE_B_CANDIDATE_POLICY_DEFAULT_MANAGEMENT.md", "hash": "bars + operator screenshot"},
 {"decision_id": "D-043", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "COMBINED RATIFICATIONS+CORRECTIONS ROUND: (1) TERMINAL-MARKER PULL-FORWARD RATIFIED - demo spec section 10 gains item 4a (terminal-marker canonical shape required BEFORE demo lane); D-035 'class stops growing' rationale formally superseded (R-008). (2) OQ-10 BUILD APPROVED under D-042 constraints; Windows-native OCR trial first, accuracy gate before trust, report-not-escalate if it fails; 311 stored media records = single-pass retrospective dataset. (3a) SURVIVORSHIP FRAMING CORRECTED in K-018: published record omits FLAT TERMINAL finishes after profitable partials, NOT losses - upward bias on card-derived expectancy, different in kind. (3b) LANE B CANDIDATE POLICY registered (work_orders/LANE_B_CANDIDATE_POLICY_DEFAULT_MANAGEMENT.md): documented default management (P-DM-1 frozen from Whaleroom Trading Guide FP-EDU-003: BE at +50 pips, 50% at TP1; limit-order-channel cadence P-DM-2 recorded separately, never merged - DIFFERENT_SPECIES) applied without explicit instruction; novelty-gated (ALREADY_KNOWN vs K-001 - correct: rules are prior art, only the shadow application is new); confirm/kill pre-registered; shadow-only; F004/F005/F007 retrospective rows explicitly labelled; prospective from F008. Lane A/constitution UNCHANGED by definition. (4a) THE 11 'SUPERSEDES' VERDICTS REVIEWED INDIVIDUALLY: all are GATE KEYWORD COLLISIONS with the rejected-records register (R-001/R-002/R-005 vocabulary: indicator/ladder/cadence terms), NOT substantive supersessions - no existing claim or design choice is overturned; each is corroboration or consistent new detail; gate granularity limitation noted (keyword matcher). (4b) G1 audio pass STARTED: verifier environment identified (.venv-vision faster-whisper; medium.en download required for the larger-model corroboration leg); first-run accuracy report due before any G1 rule flips to CANDIDATE.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_1_PROPOSED.md", "hash": "see files"},
 {"decision_id": "D-042", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "OQ-10 ELEVATED AHEAD OF QUARANTINE TOOL (operator: result cards stored byte-exact archive-wide make OCR a RETROSPECTIVE UNLOCK of his actual fills for every historical campaign in one read-only pass, feeding the n=2 divergence watch item). CAPABILITY CHECK (mandated before build): NO OCR/image-READING component exists - media_capture/* is byte-exact CAPTURE/preservation only (prospective_media_v1.db, 311 media records stored); no pytesseract/easyocr/tesseract present; PIL 12.2.0 only. Nothing to reuse for reading; nothing will be rebuilt that exists. Build constraints locked (operator): read-only over stored media; no live/gate change; record_class SOURCE_REPORTED_OUTCOME, eligible_for_prospective_evidence=false, eligible_for_training=false; extract instrument/direction/lot-label/entry/exit/displayed-result/message-id/timestamp; OCR PRICE ACCURACY SAMPLED AND REPORTED BEFORE OUTPUT IS TRUSTED (transcription-gate principle: a misread digit is worse than no data); survivorship-limited, MECHANICAL entry-divergence comparison ONLY, never expectancy. NOMINAL-OPEN REASSESSMENT (operator correction accepted): D-035's 'class stops growing' rationale WRONG - F007's P10 outcome terminal (no token) makes three members (F002,F004,F007) and outcome terminals are the COMMON case; F006->F007 spacing was 17.6h (INSIDE the 18h window) - with a growing set, consecutive-day campaigns make P02 pause-noise EXPECTED not rare; safety holds (never mis-assigns) but every affected campaign demands per-message manual review = alarm fatigue + capture degradation. RECOMMENDATION: pull terminal-marker canonical shape forward to BEFORE THE DEMO LANE (awaiting operator ratification; spec prerequisite list to be amended on approval). F007 RESOLUTION RECORDED (rows only, NO expectancy computed at n=3): F004 +15.18 / F005 NO_FILL / F007 +5.38 (PARTIALS_BANKED_RUNNER_SCRATCHED); F006 excluded. STAGE 2 REGISTER COMPLETE: 301 raw -> 108 canonical (merge map machine-verified full-coverage), novelty-gated (43 ALREADY_KNOWN corroborations, 8 GENUINELY_NEW, 44 NOT_EVIDENCED new-to-brain, 11 SUPERSEDES_PRIOR_INTERPRETATION, 2 UNKNOWN pending inspection); ENFORCED register candidate_rules_v0_1.jsonl sha d322d9e648fb35e2: 44 CANDIDATE / 35 CANDIDATE_G1_PENDING_AUDIO (frozen out until audio verification) / 20 OBSERVATION (no kill condition - forced) / 9 CRYPTO_SCOPED_EXCLUDED (K-047). SMC detector derivation (D-040 binding condition) now unblocked pending G1 audio pass + operator approval of frozen definitions.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/stage2_rule_mining/candidate_rules_v0_1.jsonl", "hash": "d322d9e648fb35e2"},
 {"decision_id": "D-041", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "WATCH-ITEM DATA DEPENDENCY RECORDED + OQ-10 RE-RANKED + STANDING RESULT-CARD CAPTURE TASK (operator directive). Dependency stated in the LANE_A_ENTRY_MODEL_ADVERSE_DIVERGENCE register entry: his actual fills exist ONLY on result-card IMAGES Orange never reads (OQ-10); every fill recorded so far came from operator screenshots; the watch item SILENTLY UNDER-RECORDS if cards go uncaptured. OQ-10 re-ranked: now the INPUT to the one emerging signal that could cut against the project's core premise; OCR proposal due when queue clears (tier SOURCE_REPORTED_OUTCOME, never Lane A outcome, never training-eligible). INTERIM MITIGATION BUILT: result_card_capture_state.json + brain_refresh (0!) alarm when a campaign reaches terminal state without captured cards (weekly-plan alarm parity; latest-snapshot-per-campaign logic; F001-F003 exempt non-prospective, F004 predates-task, F005 NO_FILL). ALARM PROVED ON FIRST REAL CASE: F007 CLOSED during the build - BE_TRIGGERED -> PARTIALS_BANKED_RUNNER_SCRATCHED -> OUTCOME_FROZEN, P10_BE_SCRATCH @4063 bar 09:29:00Z, Lane A realized +5.38 pips/unit (TP1 partials 4065.15, runner scratched at entry) - and the alarm correctly flagged F007 terminal-without-final-cards. EXPECTANCY BASIS NOW: F004 +15.18, F005 NO_FILL, F007 +5.38 (three resolved genuine prospective; F006 stays excluded). NOTED: F007's terminal is OUTCOME-based (P10, no instruction token) - THIRD member of the WIRE_NOMINAL_OPEN_OUTCOME_TERMINALS accepted-risk set (F002, F004, F007); 18h proximity window remains the guard; strengthens the registered terminal-marker future item.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/result_card_capture_state.json", "hash": "see file"},
 {"decision_id": "D-040", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "POST-HOC DETECTOR REFUSAL RATIFIED AS GOVERNANCE PRECEDENT (operator): detector definitions must NEVER be constructed after observing the rationale they will be tested against - same discipline family as pre-registered predicates and adjudication preconditions. SMC DETECTOR WORK ORDER APPROVED IN PRINCIPLE with BINDING CONDITION (work_orders/SMC_DETECTOR_WORK_ORDER_APPROVED_IN_PRINCIPLE.md): definitions (FVG tap, low sweep, CHoCH, others) must be DERIVED FROM THE STAGE 2 MINED-RULE REGISTER with per-choice transcript provenance, pre-registered with frozen sha-pinned parameters BEFORE any campaign comparison, applied prospectively from registration; retro-application to F007's rationale only as an explicitly-labelled retrospective row. NOT buildable until the Stage 2 register exists; frozen definitions then return for build approval. ALSO REGISTERED (operator): named watch item LANE_A_ENTRY_MODEL_ADVERSE_DIVERGENCE - Lane A modelled entry worse than his actual fills two campaigns running (F007: 4063.00 vs ~4060.13, ~2.9pt adverse on a LONG; F006 same class, fills outside modelled legs); if systematic, follower expectancy sits below his published results - project-core-material; measured per campaign from F008 onward; n=2, explicitly NOT a conclusion; extends K-018; no model change without governance.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/SMC_DETECTOR_WORK_ORDER_APPROVED_IN_PRINCIPLE.md", "hash": "see file"},
