 {"decision_id": "D-038", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "REVIEWER MATERIAL-GAP ROUND EXECUTED. (1) DEMO SPEC v0.2: broker-native protective stop attached AT PLACEMENT sized to the published follower stop - position protected by broker servers with ZERO dependence on Orange being alive (new section 6a); stop-less positions never carried (immediate close + alarm); stop modification-only under instruction, never removal; restart = reconcile broker state FIRST as truth before ANY action; unknown broker position/order = loud alarm + no touch; mandatory host-death test suite (hard-kill stop-survival, reconcile-first ordering, unknown-position no-touch). (2) INTEGRITY SPLIT CONFIRMED FROM DATA: (a) retrospective analysis INTACT - ingestion log 6,620 ACCEPTED bars, 0 duplicates, 0 out-of-order, providers expose only complete bars sorted by event_ts, R2 capture is cloud-side (host outages delay ingestion, never lose it); the 7 GAP windows are the daily 21-22Z metals close, the weekend, day-one 07-14 (5.5h, pre-prospective era) and two sub-5-min blips; EVERY decisive bar (zone touches + all slices) for F004/F005/F006 verified OUTSIDE all gaps - Lane A outcomes and H-FPL scoring UNAFFECTED; (b) live detection is the affected class - fills/stops seen ~94s late steady-state, unboundedly late during outages - which is what spec 6a/7 exist for. (3) LIVE_EDIT FIX (C) BUILT AND PROVEN: listener_edit_capture.py (append-only EDITED revisions, allowlist fail-closed, orphan-edit signature EDITED+supersedes-NULL, raw-text containment) + minimal MessageEdited wiring block in module_a_telegram.py (compiles; stale 'not wired' docstrings corrected); CRITICAL WIRE GAP FOUND during build: new_messages cursors by MESSAGE ID so an edit to an already-processed id could NEVER reach the wire - fixed with rowseq-cursored edit sweep (new_edit_rows + run_cycle sweep, main path now CREATED-only which is proven no-op on all 592 real rows); proofs: 19/19 capture+wire tests (incl. edit-after-transition pause alarm, edit NEVER interpreted, append-only trigger refusal), RED/GREEN edit_sweep_proof PASS, morphology 44/44 regression green. WIRE HALF DEPLOYED 07:52:20Z: live_wire.py 7a8a4c4f1281fdb9 -> a7dbb890504651b8 (banner-confirmed, PID 30612, cursor intact, fwd ledger byte-identical). LISTENER RESTART PENDING OPERATOR GO: module_a_telegram.py staged-in-place sha f75b8e8ad6107ea4 (vetted before it entered the live path); restart = seconds of capture gap with NO backfill - the moment is Martyn's call; defect stays OPEN until the restarted listener demonstrably captures an edit. (4) OQ-8 TOOL (D) BUILT: quarantine_review.py --list/--resolve/--status; durable append-only quarantine_resolutions_v0_1.jsonl (verdict enum incl. ACTIONABLE_MISSED-requires-note; DEFER stays pending; resolution binds to raw_text_hash so changed content re-queues); queue file for operator review (26 pending actionable); brain_refresh now subtracts resolutions; lifecycle tests PASS (resolve shrinks / DEFER holds / wrong-hash re-queues).", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_1_PROPOSED.md", "hash": "v0.2 + edit_sweep_proof + quarantine_review"},
 {"decision_id": "D-037", "date": "2026-07-21", "decision": "POST-DEPLOY REORDER (operator): demo-lane path re-sequenced A->B->C->D because A (spec+governance) is sign-off-bound wall-clock while B-D are build-bound. EXECUTED THIS SESSION: (A) DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_1_PROPOSED.md written PROPOSED_FOR_RATIFICATION (requires Martyn AND reviewer sign-off; nothing built/changed until ratified) - XAUUSD-only; EXECUTION_ENABLED/CTRADER_EXECUTION_ENABLED remain hard False with a separate proposed DEMO_EXECUTION_ENABLED gate; per-campaign approval; fixed 0.01-lot nominal; hard demo-account-type refusal check; file+dead-man kill switch; deterministic-client-id idempotency; broker-as-truth reconciliation; separate demo_execution_ledger with eligible_for_prospective_evidence=false on every record. (B) fill_lag_cost v0.1 MEASURED (read-only; parser_replay/fill_lag_cost_v0_1_results.json): message->actuation 3-34s (n=9 management actions, F004+F006 operational-only); bar delivery steady-state median 94s / p90 124s / max 561s with 21% of bars arriving as >600s catch-up batches after host outages -> retires the master-vNEXT 'fill_lag_cost measured' blocker AND drives spec sections 7/9 (broker-as-truth: bar-inferred fills are structurally ~1.5-2min late and outage-blind); bar-close drift on measured actions ~0 BY CONSTRUCTION (basis=message-bar close), honest exposure = intra-bar worst-case bound 12-44 pips - demo lane exists to measure the realised number. PLAIN RECORD (operator directive): GENUINE PROSPECTIVE COUNT FOR EXPECTANCY PURPOSES = 2 (F004, F005). F006 is adjudicated-closed and STATISTICALLY EXCLUDED (OUTCOME_AFFECTED_BY_DEFECT); '3 campaigns' must never be quoted for expectancy. ALSO RECORDED: alert-lane monitoring is PULL-BASED (evaluates when ORANGE_STATUS runs) - a check, not an alarm; acceptable at per-campaign approval, REVISIT BEFORE ANY AUTONOMY INCREASE. OQ-7 ESCALATED: host-reboot reliability becomes a HARD demo prerequisite once demo orders can exist (quantified by the 21% catch-up share); operator action pending. Queue after sign-off circulation: C = LIVE_EDIT fix (stage-prove-deploy, next clean window), D = OQ-8 quarantine review tool.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/DEMO_LANE_SPEC_v0_1_PROPOSED.md", "hash": "see file + fill_lag_cost_v0_1_results.json"},
