 {"decision_id": "D-025", "date": "2026-07-20", "decision": "Operator acceptances: (1) author verification ACCEPTED - demo-lane author prerequisite SATISFIED subject to OQ-9 (narrowing evidence recorded: username-convention handles; Martyn closes via relay config; exact-match fail-closed stays regardless). (2) SECOND-CHANNEL DECISION MADE: DIFFERENT_SPECIES_SEPARATE_LANE accepted - parked, not built; the settled-before-demo-lane requirement IS SETTLED by this decision; revival routes through the existing out-of-gate quarantine tripwire to the review queue. (3) COPY-BOT OBSERVATION registered FEATURE_CAPTURE_ONLY (tier PERSONAL_LIVE_METHOD_UNCONFIRMED): Farouk announced his own copy-bot 2026-04-23; carried as CONSIDERATIONS not claims - (a) post-April results may reflect automated not discretionary execution, affects interpreting his claimed outcomes; (b) mechanical execution would imply a NARROWER achievable fidelity gap for a faithful copier - relevant to demo-lane expectations; do NOT infer his current execution mode from one April announcement. (4) Multi-trader parking accepted as recorded.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/orange_brain/work_orders/LIMIT_ORDER_CHANNEL_CHARACTERISATION.md", "hash": "see file"},
