 {"decision_id": "D-021", "date": "2026-07-20", "decision": "MORPHOLOGY EXTENSION v2 BUILT AND FULLY PROVEN OFFLINE, STAGED NOT DEPLOYED. Staged files: interpreter_v2.py sha 20eee58c8bc922eb, live_wire_v2.py sha ab5950de7d2a816d (LIVE interpreter.py/live_wire.py byte-untouched - even a surprise reboot cannot load unvetted code). Proofs: failing-first RED 6/20 -> GREEN 31/31 (tests_morphology_v2); F001-F006 byte-identity 29 msgs 0 diffs (one intermediate break on 45719 - bare 'sl entry' minted a phantom SL_TO_ENTRY from retrospective text - fixed by imperative-context requirement, lesson recorded); full 43,972-row diff: ENTRY->non-ENTRY = 0 (halt clean), M->E 107 + review->ENTRY 55 (old-era entries reclaimed) + review->MANAGEMENT 65 (SL variants); zone-LABELLED dangling posts stay fail-closed (hotfix negative fixture preserved); 240-signal reconciliation 96/240 ENTRY with all 144 non-ENTRY individually named (68 OTHER = no-SL/musings/breakdowns, 30 NOT_FAROUK_GOLD = pre-Oct channel-gate era, 32 review = fail-closed correct, 14 MANAGEMENT = narrative posts + one comma-price '4,915' variant noted); sandbox battery vs v2: 40+34+40+36+34+28+68+33+31 = 344 checks ALL PASS; wire contract proven: AT_MARKET_UNPRICED -> ENTRY_UNPRICED_REVIEW record, NO campaign, NO zone synthesised; priced single-price -> PROPOSAL with degenerate zone (4635-4635, legs at price). DEPLOYMENT (Addition 1): requires restarting wire+watcher+observer; F006 is OPEN -> deployment DEFERRED until F006 closes; deploy = copy v2 files over originals + restart usual pattern + ledger byte-identity + D-018 amendment after live confirmation.", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/always_on_tradingview_receiver_plan/stage_c_tooling/farouk_plus/parser_replay/v2_reproof_results.json", "hash": "see file"},
