 {"decision_id": "D-018", "date": "2026-07-20", "decision": "D-017 AMENDED per operator checks: parser coverage = PROVEN for the CURRENT (Jun-2026+) signal era + zero-silent-drop + zero cross-instrument leak, but demo-lane prerequisite NOT YET SATISFIED. CHECK 1: archive's old-extractor records 240 Farouk XAU signals vs 16 current-parser entries; Sept-25..May-26 entries parse as quarantine/commentary/MANAGEMENT because the pre-June morphology was SINGLE-PRICE entries ('gold long sl 5090', 'XAUUSD SELL 4635 SL @ 4670', 'High-risk short... entry 4740.2 Stop loss at 4762') - zone-based regexes miss them; WORST CLASS: old entry 'gold long sl 5090' classifies as MANAGEMENT/REVISED_STOP (entry read as stop-move; wire orphan-handling would fail it closed, but for a copy trader = order never placed). CHECK 2: 30-sample of 274 stop-wording quarantines -> ~13-15/27 assessable (~50%) are ACTIONABLE instructions in unrecognised variants: 'stoploss to entry' (one word), 'sl entry' (no to/at), 'stop loss now at N'/'set stop-loss at N', typo 'enty', 'take 90% sl entry' - mostly old-era but phrasing variants are timeless. VERDICT: demo lane stays GATED until morphology extension (single-price entries + SL-variant family) is built WITH APPROVAL and re-proven by replay. MINOR RECORDED: 4-digit gold-shaped zone/SL regexes are a hardcoded assumption - brittle if gold prints 5 digits. [AMENDED 2026-07-21 by D-036: prerequisite SATISFIED - morphology extension v2.1 approved, fully proven and DEPLOYED LIVE; see D-036 for shas and verification.]", "authority": "research/farouk_pilot/always_on_tradingview_receiver_plan/stage_c_tooling/farouk_plus/parser_replay/PARSER_COVERAGE_REPLAY_REPORT.md", "hash": "amended - see D-018 note appended to report"},
